cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Dacă folosiți acest program, vă rugăm să-l citați astfel. / If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Clima ANM: analize climatice pe cubul Zarr anm-daily-grids (EOCube.ro)"
abstract: >-
  Clima ANM is a portable, local program with a browser interface for climate analyses on the daily
  1 km gridded data of the Romanian National Meteorological Administration (ANM), 1961–present, served as the
  Zarr data cube anm-daily-grids by EOCube.ro. It computes maps, anomalies, trends with significance tests,
  ETCCDI and percentile-based indices, SPI/SPEI, record-breaking (superlative) analyses, zonal statistics and
  data-integrity checks, and writes reproducible, documented outputs (COG GeoTIFF, PNG, GeoPackage, CSV, HTML
  run sheets). Built for teaching (GIS and climatology master's courses) at the University of Bucharest.
